## Ignorar archivos de Visual Studio y .NET

# User-specific files
*.rsuser
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# Build results
[Dd]ebug/
[Dd]ebugPublic/
[Rr]elease/
[Rr]eleases/
x64/
x86/
[Ww][Ii][Nn]32/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]64/
bld/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/

# Visual Studio cache/options
.vs/
.vscode/
.vsidx/

# MSTest test Results
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
[Bb]uild[Ll]og.*

# NuGet Packages
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
**/packages/*
!**/packages/build/

# SQL Server files
*.mdf
*.ldf
*.ndf

# Entity Framework Migrations (opcional - descomentar si no quieres subirlas)
# **/Migrations/

# User secrets y configuraci�n local
appsettings.Development.json
appsettings.*.json
!appsettings.json

# Connection strings (IMPORTANTE: no subir credenciales)
connectionstrings.json

# wwwroot compiled files (si usas bundling)
wwwroot/dist/
wwwroot/lib/

# Fotos subidas por el panel de personalización (datos de runtime, no código)
BarberiaWeb/wwwroot/uploads/*
!BarberiaWeb/wwwroot/uploads/.gitkeep

# Node modules (si usas npm)
node_modules/

# Database files
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# Backup files
*.bak

# OS generated files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db